[I] A command-line benchmarking tool

[T] Hyperfine is a command-line benchmarking tool designed to measure and
[T] compare the execution time of commands or programs with high precision. It
[T] provides statistical analysis including mean time, standard deviation, and
[T] outlier detection.

[U] https://github.com/sharkdp/hyperfine

